{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803780/extras/b86f36a86e18d6d13f7ba83fd60c23e4.avif?t=1772417622\" width=780 height=76 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the protagonist awakens, he finds himself in the &quot;Succubus World&quot; \u2014 a realm inhabited by succubi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can he avoid their interference and safely escape back to his original world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803780/extras/0be53ab60f5881909d00800d7ba0208f.avif?t=1772417622\" width=781 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a side-scrolling RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players control the protagonist, exploring the labyrinth and defeating succubi in order to escape from the Succubus World.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>Simple &amp; Satisfying Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803780/extras/6fa338c658edba93b0147faa8268b645.avif?t=1772417622\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy intuitive, tactile controls.<br>That\u2019s all you need:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Jump,&quot; &quot;Dodge,&quot; and &quot;Slash&quot;!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>Discover Treasures and Unlock New Areas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803780/extras/4f0b5df8789cdca5c47afa6c923d7171.avif?t=1772417622\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, it's a 2D exploration action game\u2014your classic Metroidvania.<br>Across the map, you\u2019ll find various treasure items.<br>Obtain new weapons and gear, and head off to explore new areas!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>Designed for Easy Play!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803780/extras/23be2d64c22dcaefc423dc4ac5d193c4.avif?t=1772417622\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change difficulty anytime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast travel from anywhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retry instantly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad supported</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key configuration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto text advance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable text speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skip event scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destination guidance display</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more...</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3803780?t=1772417622","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3803780?t=1772417622","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803780/9c3073392112e52fbd2135ffa871d6b7ac339cdb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772417622","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803780/9c3073392112e52fbd2135ffa871d6b7ac339cdb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772417622","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Some scenes in the game will contain sexually suggestive content that is not suitable for minors; Please decide whether to pl